<root>
	<styles>
		<include src="s2r://panorama/styles/custom_game/hud_shared.vcss_c" />
		<include src="s2r://panorama/styles/custom_game/weapon_hud.vcss_c" />
	</styles>

	<!--
		Weapon selection, split by team.

		The shell - hud-screen, hud-root, hud-card, hud-head, hud-foot and the reveal animation - all
		comes from hud_shared. Only the two columns and the tile grid are specific to this menu, so a
		different panel reuses the same chrome by using the same class names.

		SHAPE: two columns, 5 categories each, 12 options per category laid out 4 per line.
		Groups 0-4 are T, 5-9 are CT - the plugin's Categories array is in that order and the
		two have to agree. Panorama cannot wrap, so each line of 4 is its own panel and the plugin
		collapses the ones a category does not fill.

		DRIVEN BY:
		  team_t / team_ct   {s:}     - team names
		  grp{g}            hidden   - empty category collapses out
		  grp{g}_r{k}       hidden   - unused line collapses
		  grp{g}_label      {s:}     - category name
		  w{g}_{c}          hidden   - unused tile collapses
		  w{g}_{c}          selected - toggle state
		  w{g}_{c}          icon-*   - weapon picture
		  w{g}_{c}          {s:}     - weapon name
		  wsel_save / wsel_close       - footer
	-->
